      "comment": "ALTONA BEACH (1) sprung the lids and on speed throughout before being run over late when fourth (18.97) at this track over 350m. Can bounce back. CYCLONE TIM (3) has a strong record here with four wins and five placings from 12 starts. Was out of placings last time (20.24) at Capalaba in a Grade 4/5, finishing sixth and beaten 2.25 lengths. With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. CAKE IS YUMMY (2) continued her winning form with another strong run after running them ragged to make it back to back wins, scoring by one length (22.10) at Q Lakeside over 390m. Form should stack up. KALINA PEARL (8) is not to be discarded.",
